=2 Preparation
>Temple of Uggalepih
!Temple of Uggalepih-map2-with-additional-markers.jpg||(Map 2)
* **Optional**: You can do this now or before the next Mission: if you have to wait the full day reset, you can go obtain a {@i:Doll Gizmo|1268} {i:Doll Gizmo|Doll Gizmo|1268} in the meantime, as you'll need it for the next Mission. This will prevent us extra teleporting around / walking back and forth to Beaucedine Glacier later.
** You can buy them from the **Auction House** under **Others** > **Misc. 1**.
** It's also a 100% drop from the {m:Manipulator} in {z:Temple of Uggalepih} Map 2 at (I-10)/(J-10) patrolling in the big room.
*** Proto-Waypoint is the closest warp.
*** The {p:Unity Concord} (Level 125) Warp is also a quick way to reach this NM. You will have to defeat the door guardian to get through the door to reach your target.
*** The Manipulator respawns every 15 minutes.

=2 Walkthrough
>Beaucedine Glacier
!Beaucedine Glacier-map.jpg||Beaucedine Glacier map
* Speak with {p:Halver} for a cutscene to begin the Mission.
* Speak with {p:Rahal} in the **Royal Knight's Quarters** for another cutscene.
* Head to {z:Beaucedine Glacier}.
** The quickest way is via {p:Survival Guide} (Fauregandi).
* Touch the **Ferric Stench** (H-8) next to the East side of the tower to begin a confrontation with:
** Orcish Atlatl (WAR)
** Orcish Axeman (BST)
** Orcish Praetor (WAR)
** Harnessed Smilodon (WAR)
*** You will receive {@k} {k:Carmine Swallows' map} after the fight.
* Touch the **Ferric Stench** again for a cutscene.
* Touch the **Point of Interest** at the lowest left corner intersection of (J-6)/(I-6) for a final cutscene.
** This is located on the lowest level, next to the **Mirror Pond**.
** Fastest route is Unity warp 128 {z:Fei'Yin} and zone out into {z:Beaucedine Glacier}. **Can mount here**
** You will receive {@i:Hi-Elixir Tank|26271} {i:Hi-Elixir Tank|Hi-Elixir Tank|26271} after the cutscene.
* **{c=red:Note:}** If you're heading to the next Mission, **do not warp away**!

